      "html" : "<\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-163548\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-163548\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\">The runoff rate shall be calculated using the rational method, Equation 11-1. The calculation shall incorporate the total site area with a rainfall intensity value of <\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\">I<\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\"> = 5.95 inches per hour. The weighted runoff coefficient shall be calculated using Equation 11-2 and shall incorporate the different combinations of surfaces using the <\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\">C<\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\"> values listed below.<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-163549\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-163549\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Q<\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\"> = <\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">C<\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">w<\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\"> &#215; <\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">I<\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\"> &#215; <\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">A<\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;(Equation 11-1)<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-163550\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-163550\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\">where:<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-163551\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-163551\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;<\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Q<\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;=&#160;&#160;&#160;developed flow, cubic feet per second<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-163552\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-163552\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;<\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">C<\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: sub;display: inline;font-size:8pt;\">w<\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;=&#160;&#160;&#160;weighted runoff coefficient<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-163553\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-163553\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;<\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">I<\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;=&#160;&#160;&#160;the rainfall intensity value, 5.95 in\/hr<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-163554\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-163554\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;<\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">A<\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: